advise|Recommendation rather than binding instruction is intended. Person-to-infinitive and bare gerund constructions checked; Vietnamese extra water and walking purpose are retained without adding health claims.
gold|Metal noun and colour adjective split with supported ordinals. Jewellery processing and curtain colour translate directly; gold curtains are not assumed to be made of gold metal.
mandate|Delegated authority/task matches committee review, with no claim of a real political mandate. Vietnamese stays standalone and the construction distinguishes granting body from authorized activity.
rumor|Unconfirmed does not mean proven false, avoiding an overly narrow definition. Closure claim and timing before owner response preserve uncertainty in Vietnamese; regional spelling is not canonical identity approval.
united|Shared aim or agreement fits garden protection effort. Still united does not imply unanimity on every topic; Vietnamese preserves continuing cooperation and the in complement.
